  ('MACRO_FX', 'CONDITIONAL', 'PARTIAL', 'Inflation (September 2026) and the policy rate (22 Oct 2026) recorded as reported. The CBRT residential property price index for Istanbul and the CBRT indicative USD/TRY rate are not yet recorded; no conversion is shown.'),
